              <p>Create or edit events from the calendar and connect them to notes so meetings, deadlines, and plans always have written context.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="docs-card">
              <h4>Action extraction</h4>
              <p>Checklist items in notes are treated as actionable items. This keeps planning inside the note instead of splitting it into separate apps.</p>
